        "official_en_sha256": "f2538531b125afc80ea78d86161e636c114c5dbe30ab744ff17be2f0e4811d99"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "たとえ恐ろしい記憶だとしても、それもわたくしの一部です。\r\nこのまま失ったままではいたくありません。",
        "official_en": "A wretched memory it may be, yet it remains a part of who I am. To forget it would bring me no solace.",
        "real_en": "Even if they're terrible memories, they're part of who I am. I don't want to leave them lost forever."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
